cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. A paper is in preparation."
title: living-context
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: MacDougall
    given-names: Eric
repository-code: "https://github.com/ericmacdougall/living-context"
license: BUSL-1.1
version: 0.1.0-dev
abstract: >-
  Layered, self-reorganising long-term memory for AI agents: size-bounded
  leaves under a recursive summary tree, recall by parallel fan-out, graph
  cross-links and an evidence-driven reorganisation loop. Experimental; the
  method is not proven.
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - retrieval
  - long-term memory
